Z||000000||rogergarrison||11-02-2001||06:37 PM||||Talk about cheapskates, now they dont even have check out clerks. I go to line with a cart full of about $200.00 worth of stuff and there I find they have done away with clerks and installed checkouts that you do yourself. The scanner takes up almost all the space on the little counter (about a foot square) so there is no place to put your items when you empty the cart. so you end up going to get another cart so you can scan from one and put them in the other. Now we all know that there are plenty of items that dont scan, specially items on sale. So, of course I have several. No one to help figure out what to do next. So after 30 mins of screwing around i just leave the cart, items right where they lay and walk out the door. They wont be seeing me again. Hello Miers or Walmart. So I guess now that they dont have any payroll for clerks, theyll have to figure out how to make money when no one shops there anymore.||||reg||8
