Z||000007||Reality||11-02-2001||07:42 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B>hey anthony, ya they had one clerk, she had a line of about 20 customers, and all the self service ones empty. Did any of the execs from Pontiac (aka Fiero) move to K-mart offices   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ? seems the bean counters are infecting us everywhere.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Not that I know of but the Columbus district is considered what they call a broke district. In other words it needs a lot of work. Nect time it's like that go up to the service desk and tell the person running it that they might want to call a Code C then walk out leaving you shopping cart of merchandise sitting infront of the desk.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Makes them real mad!||||reg||1
