Z||000021||Voytek||11-15-2001||02:25 PM||||Hey now, wait all you K-mart bashers.  I've worked at K-mart for 3 years at one time and I gave the best service to all the customers.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  (hmmmm, shortly after I left, they shot down in Canada...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"> ) I still have a K-mart T-shirt which I wear on special occasions (Flashy can attest to that  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ).<BR>Come to think of it, I was sad to see the place go.  Now we have WalMarts all over the place (with a couple local stores and a couple Sears stores).<BR>As far as the subject of this thread, I wouldn't like the self-serve checkouts (we don't have them here yet) but I'm certain K-mart won't be the only one with this system.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000022||malacite||11-15-2001||03:51 PM||||First off, i work for K-Mart. K-Mart bought me my Fiero. K-Mart also gave me all the money i needed to fix it up.<P>Quite frankly, i think the self-serve checkouts are the stupidist things since the Blue-Light internet service.<BR>especially when i want to buy somthing after i am off the clock. "Gee i'm done working now, no wait, i still have to check myself out."<P>i'd rather have an enema...<P>yes, k-mart sucks unless you are and old woman<BR>Target sucks unless you are a 14 year old girl<BR>and Walmart sucks unless you are married to your sister.<P>i will be wearing a flame-proof suit for the next few weeks. i've also got a fire extinguisher and i'm not afraid to use it!<P>peace out!<P>------------------<BR>Malacite<P>Grendel-88 Fiero RIP<BR>'94 Saturn SW2 RallySport<BR>'95 Saturn SL1 Touring||||reg||8
